!Lojbanist List

it would be great to have a list of the following things:

* nickname(s) and full name (not necessarily, though - everyone should decide for themself what to make public here)
** link this to their userpage or their tikiwiki-userdetails-page or something
* where they are to be found (having expressive icons for these would be a great idea IMO)
** on irc?
** on the beginners mailing list?
** on the lojban mailing list?
** available for VoIP or similar stuff
* waking hours (this was a very valuable suggestion!)
* amount of skill
** maybe have a uniform scale? everyone should be allowed to select for themselves what to put there, though, so no feelings are hurt :)
* what else? maybe a comment field?

!!Tidying up the wiki!

There are lots of partially redundant and mostly also outdated and often also incomplete wikipages on the wiki regarding lojbanists.
The userlist we are trying to create here should replace all those pages and they should be dropped from the wiki (loss of interesting data should be minimised, though)

